  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The ThinkingLogManager class provides a robust service for managing persistent, structured logs of the AI's internal 'thinking' processes. It ensures thread-safe operations by implementing file locking mechanisms to prevent concurrent write conflicts. The component manages two distinct log streams: a specific, user-defined log file and a global active session log. It handles filesystem interactions, including directory creation, and provides methods to write content, start sessions, and read historical logs."
  },
